flowchart TD
    RAW[Raw ASV counts including controls and full taxonomy] --> QC[Optional biological-only depth QC]
    QC --> TECH[TECH prevalence: biological plus technical negatives]
    QC --> BIO[BIO prevalence: biological plus biological/sample controls]
    TECH --> UNION[Union removal; retain original biological counts]
    BIO --> UNION
    UNION --> REF[Reference-based non-target screening]
    REF --> FEATURES[FILTER_ASVS: mock 0.1% RA in any biological sample AND 5% nonzero prevalence]
    RAW -->|Decontamination disabled| REF
    FEATURES --> TARGET[ASV_target.tsv: non-target-filtered microbial counts]
    TARGET --> SELECT[PLOT_METADATA: linked long and wide tables]
    SELECT --> GROUP[Selected-cohort diagnostics / validated labels]
    GROUP --> BATCH[Optional batch correction and count selection]
    BATCH --> DIVERSITY[Full biological cohort: diversity]
    BATCH --> COHORT[ANALYSIS_COHORT: configured group selection]
    COHORT --> FINAL[Selected counts and synchronized long annotations]
    FINAL --> STATS[Statistical and network modules]
    DIVERSITY --> REPORT
    STATS --> REPORT[Module files and integrated report]
    classDef input fill:#DAE8FC,stroke:#6C8EBF,color:#111111
    classDef output fill:#D5E8D4,stroke:#82B366,color:#111111
    class RAW input
    class FINAL,REPORT output
